Share\nL52: \nL53: Abstract\nL54: \nL55: Flavensomycinoic acid, the N-containing moiety common to the Streptomyces sp. antibiotics flavensomycin and prasinons A and B, shows only weak insecticidal activity compared with the parent substances.\nL56: \nL57: [Input]\nL58: \nL59: References (6)\nL60: \nL61: Related articles (0)\nL62: \nL63: Figures (0)\nL64: \nL65: 【14†Image】 Content from these authors\nL66: \nL67: Supplementary material (0)\nL68: \nL69: Result List ()\nL70: \nL71: Cited by (3)\nL72: © Japan Antibiotics Research Association\nL73: \nL74: 【15†Previous article】 【16†Next article】\nL75: \nL76: Favorites & Alerts\nL77: \nL78:   * Add to favorites\nL79:   * Additional info alert\nL80:   * Citation alert\nL81:   * Authentication alert\nL82: \nL83: [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input]\nL84: \nL85: 【14†Image】\nL86: \nL87: Related articles\nL88: \nL89: Recently viewed articles\nL90: \nL91: Predecessor\nL92: \nL93: 【17†The Journal of Antibiotics, Series A】\nL94: \nL95: Share this page\nL96: \nL97: 【18†Top】\nL98: ### Register with J-STAGE for free!\nL99: \nL100: 【19†Register】\nL101: \nL102: Already have an account? Sign in 【20†here】\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nA rare peptide scaffold in kineomicins, the glycopeptide antibiotics produced by Actinokineospora auranticolor DSM 44650 - PMC (https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12049478/)\nciteturn41view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 6 days ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12049478/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 704\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Image†cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】 Search\nL3: \nL4: 【2†Image†cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】 Log in 【3†Image†cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】 【4†Image†cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL5: \nL6:   * 【5†Dashboard†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL7:   * 【6†Publications†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL8:   * 【7†Account settings†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL9:   * [Button: Log out ]\nL10: \nL11: Search… [Input: